      ":question/problem": "Find $j$, if $2{a}_{1}+j{a}_{2}=0$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
